[1.906331, "o", "5ee9a90 docs: README (architecture, run, security decisions, trade-offs), the agents contract and the demo script\r\ncf0ca24 fix(sanitizer): a card window never cuts a following SSN\r\naea26d4 fix(sanitizer): a separator change ends a number, so an SSN after a failed card is redacted\r\n3de1127 feat(sanitizer): mutation check, docs and hardening tests\r\na7186e3 fix(audit): lint-clean key regexes, no super-linear padding strip\r\n"]
